@host = http://localhost:5242

### No headers at all: falls back to Captcha:DefaultProvider.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/open
Captcha-Response: any-token-the-test-key-accepts

### Type alone matches Default and AdminPortal; the default wins rather than failing as ambiguous.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/open
Captcha-Type: recaptcha
Captcha-Response: any-token-the-test-key-accepts

### Site key alone identifies the hCaptcha instance.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/open
Captcha-SiteKey: 10000000-ffff-ffff-ffff-000000000001
Captcha-Response: 10000000-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000001

### Two Turnstile instances differ only by site key, which is what selects between them.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/open
Captcha-Type: turnstile
Captcha-SiteKey: 1x00000000000000000000BB
Captcha-Response: XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX

### Pinned: the endpoint chooses the instance and the headers cannot move it.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/admin
Captcha-Response: any-token-the-test-key-accepts

### Rejected as provider_mismatch: this endpoint pins a reCAPTCHA instance.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/admin
Captcha-Type: turnstile
Captcha-Response: XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX

### Rejected as provider_mismatch: the pinned Kiosk instance uses a different site key.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/kiosk
Captcha-SiteKey: 1x00000000000000000000AA
Captcha-Response: XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX

### Rejected as unknown_provider: no instance is configured with that site key.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/open
Captcha-SiteKey: 9x99999999999999999999ZZ
Captcha-Response: any-token

### Rejected as score_unavailable: reCAPTCHA v2 reports no score, so High cannot be satisfied.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/strict
Captcha-Type: recaptcha
Captcha-Response: any-token-the-test-key-accepts

### Rejected as action_unavailable: v2 has no concept of an action.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/action
Captcha-Type: recaptcha
Captcha-Response: any-token-the-test-key-accepts

### Rejected as missing_response: no token at all.
POST {{host}}/api/demo/open
Captcha-Type: recaptcha

### The same guard without MVC.
POST {{host}}/api/minimal
Captcha-Response: any-token-the-test-key-accepts
